    "title": [
        "Paris in the spring",
        "巴黎之春"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Hello, Ken.",
                "你好，肯。"
            ],
            [
                "Hi, George.",
                "你好，乔治。"
            ],
            [
                "Have you just been to the cinema?",
                "你刚去过电影院吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Yes, I have.",
                "是的，我刚去过。"
            ],
            [
                "What's on?",
                "上映什么片子？"
            ],
            [
                "'Paris in the spring'.",
                "「巴黎之春」。"
            ],
            [
                "Oh, I've already seen it. I saw it on television last year.",
                "噢，我已看过了。我是去年在电视上看的。"
            ],
            [
                "It's an old film, but it's very good.",
                "这是老部片子，但很好。"
            ],
            [
                "Paris is a beautiful city.",
                "巴黎是座美丽的城市。"
            ],
            [
                "I've never been there. Have you ever been there, Ken?",
                "我从未去过。肯，你去过吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Yes, I have. I was there in April.",
                "是的，我去过。4月份我在那儿。"
            ],
            [
                "Paris in the spring, eh?",
                "那是巴黎之春，是吗？"
            ],
            [
                "It was spring, but the weather was awful. It rained all the time.",
                "是春天，但天气太糟了。一直在下雨。"
            ],
            [
                "Just like London.",
                "就像伦敦一样。"
            ]
        ]
    },
